sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant UI as Admin UI
    participant API as API Gateway
    participant Orchestrator as Orchestrator
    participant Queue as Job Queue
    participant Worker as Worker
    participant Audit as Audit Log

    UI->>API: Submit maintenance workflow request
    API->>Orchestrator: Start maintenance plan
    Orchestrator->>Queue: Enqueue step one
    Queue-->>Worker: Dispatch step one
    Worker->>Audit: Persist step one progress
    Audit-->>Worker: Confirm progress persisted
    Worker-->>Queue: Step one complete
    Queue-->>Orchestrator: Step one completion received
    Orchestrator->>Queue: Enqueue step two
    Queue-->>Worker: Dispatch step two
    Worker->>Audit: Persist step two progress
    Audit-->>Worker: Confirm step two persisted
    Worker-->>Queue: Step two complete
    Queue-->>Orchestrator: Step two completion received
    Orchestrator-->>API: Workflow completed with final status and audit references
    API-->>UI: Return completion response for operator refresh
